{
  "id": "how-to-setup-secrets-tutorial",
  "title": "How To Setup Secrets Management",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Create and manage credentials for Synthetic Monitoring browser checks. Creating or deleting secrets requires Grafana Admin access; ask an administrator to complete these steps if you do not have permission. If the two example secrets already exist, skip their creation steps and confirm their names in the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Open the configuration page for Synthetic Monitoring secrets."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "naviage-to-testing-multistep-guided",
      "title": "Navigate to Secrets Configuration",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
          "content": "Open **Synthetic Monitoring > Config > Secrets**.",
          "showMe": false,
          "verify": "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You have located the secrets configuration."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Create the two credentials used by the example browser check."
    },
