    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "create-check-with-secrets",
      "title": "Create A Check With A Synthetic Monitoring Secret",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks",
          "content": "Open **Checks** to create a browser check using the saved secrets.",
          "showMe": false,
          "verify": "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks",
          "skippable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='action create check']",
          "content": "Select Create A Check\n---\nLet's start building a check that uses your secrets.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "skippable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "div[data-testid='check-group-card-browser'] a:nth-match(1)",
          "content": "Create Browser Check\n---\nChoose Browser as the check type. This type of check supports secrets management.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "skippable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "content": "Let's Setup Browser Check\n---\nEnter the basic check configuration:",
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "input[data-testid='checkEditor form job']",
              "targetvalue": "Test:QuickPizza",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "input[data-testid='checkEditor form instance']",
              "targetvalue": "https://quickpizza.grafana.com/admin",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "skippable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "The browser script references `quickpizza-username` and `quickpizza-password` through the k6 secrets module. Both secrets must exist before you run the check."
        },
        {
          "type": "code-block",
          "reftarget": "div[data-testid='data-testid Code editor container']",
          "language": "javascript",
          "code": "import { browser } from \"k6/browser\";\nimport { expect } from \"https://jslib.k6.io/k6-testing/0.5.0/index.js\";\nimport { check } from 'https://jslib.k6.io/k6-utils/1.5.0/index.js';\nimport secrets from 'k6/secrets';\n\n// ------------------------------------------------------------//\n//   Record your browser script using Grafana k6 Studio!       //\n//   Visit https://grafana.com/docs/k6-studio/set-up/install/  //\n// ------------------------------------------------------------//\n\nexport const options = {\n  scenarios: {\n    default: {\n      executor: \"shared-iterations\",\n      options: { browser: { type: \"chromium\" } },\n    },\n  },\n};\n\n// This example logs into quickpizza.grafana.com\nexport default async function () {\n  const context = await browser.newContext();\n  const page = await context.newPage();\n  try {\n    await page.goto('https://quickpizza.grafana.com/admin', { waitUntil: 'networkidle' });\n\n    // TIP: Secure your credentials using secrets.get()\n    // https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/testing/synthetic-monitoring/create-checks/manage-secrets/\n    const username = await secrets.get('quickpizza-username');\n    const password = await secrets.get('quickpizza-password');\n\n    await page.getByRole('textbox', { name: 'Username' }).fill(username);\n    await page.getByRole('textbox', { name: 'Password' }).fill(password);\n\n    const signIn = page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Sign in' });\n    await signIn.click();\n    await expect(signIn).toBeHidden();\n\n    const heading = page.getByRole('heading');\n    await expect(heading).toBeVisible();\n    console.log('H2 header: ', await heading.textContent()); // will appear as logs in Loki\n\n    // TIP: Use expect() to immediately abort execution and fail a test (impacts uptime/reachability)\n    await expect(heading).toContainText(\"Latest pizza recommendations\");\n\n    // TIP: Use check() to report test results in the 'assertions' dashboard panel\n    // Scripts continue to run even if a check fails. Failed checks don't impact uptime and reachability\n    await check(heading, {\n      [\"Header is present\"]: async (h) => (await h.textContent()) == \"Latest pizza recommendations\"\n    });\n\n  } catch (e) {\n    console.log('Error during execution:', e);\n    throw e;\n  } finally {\n    await page.close();\n  }\n}",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='checkEditor navigation execution']",
          "content": "Open **Execution**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "guided",
          "content": "Select the first available probe for this example, then resume the section. You can choose additional locations in **Execution**.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "label[data-testid='checkEditor form probeLabel']:nth-match(1)",
              "targetstate": "true",
              "description": "Select a probe location for this check.",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='checkEditor navigation alerting']",
          "content": "Open **Alerting** and review any alerts you want to enable.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='checkEditor form submit']:not([disabled])",
          "content": "Click **Save**. Wait for the saved check page to open.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "h1:text('Test:QuickPizza')",
          "content": "Confirm that the saved check dashboard shows **Test:QuickPizza**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "verify": "exists-reftarget",
          "skippable": false
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "is-admin",
        "section-completed:performace-multistep-guided"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You have connected a browser check to saved credentials."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Review how to update and remove the example credentials."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "guide-section-81179",
      "title": "How To Edit & Delete Secrets",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
          "content": "Return to **Secrets** to manage the credentials.",
          "showMe": false,
          "verify": "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
          "skippable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "guided",
          "content": "Optionally update quickpizza-username. Skip this step to keep the current value; cancel any open dialog before skipping.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
            "is-admin"
          ],
          "skippable": true,
          "stepTimeout": 120000,
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "button[aria-label='Edit quickpizza-username']",
              "description": "Open the username secret.",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid='config secret-edit-modal'] button:text('Reset')",
              "description": "Reset the configured value so you can enter its replacement.",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid='config secret-edit-modal'] textarea#secret-value:not([disabled])",
              "description": "Enter the replacement username yourself.",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ],
              "targetvalue": "^.+$",
              "validateInput": true
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid='config secret-edit-modal'] button[type='submit']:not([disabled])",
              "description": "Save the updated secret.",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "hover",
          "reftarget": "body:not(:has([data-testid='config secret-edit-modal'])) button[aria-label='Edit quickpizza-username']",
          "content": "The secrets list is visible after the update or skipped edit.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "verify": "exists-reftarget",
          "skippable": false
        },
        {
          "type": "guided",
          "content": "Optionally delete quickpizza-password if you no longer need it. Skip this step to keep it; cancel any open dialog before skipping.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
            "is-admin"
          ],
          "skippable": true,
          "stepTimeout": 120000,
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "button[aria-label='Delete quickpizza-password']",
              "description": "Open the confirmation for quickpizza-password.",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "[role='dialog'] input[data-testid='data-testid Confirm Modal Input']",
              "description": "Type DELETE to confirm this deletion.",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ],
              "targetvalue": "DELETE",
              "validateInput": true
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "[role='dialog'] button[data-testid='data-testid Confirm Modal Danger Button']:not([disabled])",
              "description": "Delete the named secret only if you no longer need it.",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "guided",
          "content": "Optionally delete quickpizza-username if you no longer need it. Skip this step to keep it; cancel any open dialog before skipping.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
            "is-admin"
          ],
          "skippable": true,
          "stepTimeout": 120000,
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "button[aria-label='Delete quickpizza-username']",
              "description": "Open the confirmation for quickpizza-username.",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "[role='dialog'] input[data-testid='data-testid Confirm Modal Input']",
              "description": "Type DELETE to confirm this deletion.",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ],
              "targetvalue": "DELETE",
              "validateInput": true
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "[role='dialog'] button[data-testid='data-testid Confirm Modal Danger Button']:not([disabled])",
              "description": "Delete the named secret only if you no longer need it.",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/config/secrets",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "is-admin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You have learned how to maintain or remove saved credentials."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You can now create, reference, update, and remove Synthetic Monitoring secrets."
